%N A038224 Triangle whose (i,j)-th entry is binomial(i,j)*3^(i-j)*6^j.
%H A038224 Björg N. Cyvín, Jon Brunvoll, and Sven J. Cyvín, <a href="http://match.pmf.kg.ac.rs/electronic_versions/Match34/match34_109-121.pdf">Isomer enumeration of unbranched catacondensed polygonal systems with pentagons and heptagons</a>, Match, No. 34 (Oct 1996), 109-121.
%F A038224 T(n,k) = 6*T(n-1,k-1) + 3*T(n-1,k) with T(0,0)=1, T(n,k)=0 for k<0 or k>n. - _Ranjan Kumar Dhani_, Oct 09 2026
